### 200 OK — the happy path (green status pill)
GET https://httpbin.org/status/200

### 404 Not Found (orange pill)
GET https://httpbin.org/status/404

### 418 I'm a teapot
GET https://httpbin.org/status/418

### 500 Internal Server Error (red pill)
GET https://httpbin.org/status/500

### Redirect — follows to /get and shows the final URL
GET https://httpbin.org/redirect-to?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhttpbin.org%2Fget&status_code=302

### Slow response (~2s) — watch the timing readout
GET https://httpbin.org/delay/2

### Connection refused — transport error, no HTTP status
GET http://localhost:59999/nobody-listens-here

### Binary response — a PNG; the body is not displayed, only its size
GET https://httpbin.org/image/png
Accept: image/png

### Local: Tide Commander's own health endpoint (works offline, env "local")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
